        "text": "={{ $('Describe The Failure').isExecuted ? $('Describe The Failure').first().json.detail : $('Describe The Problem').first().json.detail }}\n\nNothing was lost: every message is in the wa_messages table first. Open n8n → Executions to see the run.",
